  (text "JP1: fit ONE shunt only; 1-2 = NM27C512 12.75V, 2-3 = adjusted HIGH for a verified adapter.\nNo shunt = VPP disconnected / discharged. Do not change JP1 with either supply powered.\nRV2: adjust actual VPP_SW to 12.75V under load. RV3: adjust HIGH to the exact device voltage.\nU12/U13 tabs are OUTPUTS: separate insulated heatsinks. Programming still defaults OFF on RESET." (at 20 302 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "2dbf22ab-e3f6-58d4-9497-d927b619b8e7"))
